          "title": "You'll want to know: மலைப்பு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மலைப்பு — malaippu — \"awe; being overwhelmed\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அவ்வளவு பெரிய கோயிலைப் பார்த்து எனக்கு மலைப்பாக இருந்தது. avvaḷavu periya kōyilaip pārttu eṉakku malaippāka iruntatu. I was awestruck to see such a big temple."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Not from மலை \"a hill\" but from a verb மலை \"to be staggered\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மலைப்பு (malaippu) is native Dravidian (DEDR 4736): the entry gives a verb மலை malai, \"to be staggered, amazed\", and this noun beside it."
            }
          ]
        },
